  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>模組包：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">將 Minecraft 變成全面殭屍末日所需的一切，就像在我的 YouTube 頻道（<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yaboysneak\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@yaboysneak</a>）中看到的一樣！如果有問題歡迎隨時聯繫我&nbsp;，我會盡力回覆。隨您喜好進行任何修改，盡情享受！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">殭屍主題模組包，包含全新護甲與武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">全新的生成結構與世界生成</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">自訂殭屍與動畫</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">載具與槍械</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">獨特物品，還有更多！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>在伺服器上遊玩（點擊橫幅！）：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSNEAK\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/cbfc0ef9-e5d2-4095-891f-8c898b76f012.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>查看我的頻道：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ie04ovLG2VM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></